        "<strong>American Society for Dermatologic Surgery (ASDS)</strong> – Injectables and Dermal Fillers<br><a href=\"https://www.asds.net/skin-experts/skin-treatments/injectables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.asds.net/skin-experts/skin-treatments/injectables</a>",
        "<strong>Mayo Clinic</strong> – Botulinum Toxin (Botox) Overview<br><a href=\"https://www.mayoclinic.org/tests-procedures/botox/about/pac-20384658\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.mayoclinic.org/tests-procedures/botox/about/pac-20384658</a>",
        "<strong>StatPearls (NCBI Bookshelf)</strong> – Botulinum Toxin and Dermal Fillers: Clinical Overview<br><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/</a>",
